{"parse": {"title": "Summer Star", "pageid": 4303, "revid": 26990, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/47/Summer_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20230803141525\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Summer Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/47/Summer_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230803141525\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"179\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Summer Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Summer_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Summer_Star.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Summer Star</b> is a new obtainable item introduced in the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Summer</a> update which can be bought for 150 Pearls from the Navi NPC next to spawn!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Inside the <b>Summer Star</b>, you can discover 4 new exclusive units and 13 different Summer themed skins!</li>\n<li>If you haven't received a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> after 400 <b>Summer Stars</b>, you will get one guaranteed!</li>\n<li>Roger is not obtainable through <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> pity.</li>\n<li>The 4 exclusive units are Harribu, Kizume, Avdo, and secret unit Roger</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Star_Chances\">Star Chances</span></h2>\n<div style=\"font-family: &#39;Fredoka One&#39;,rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #0d8cff;\">Rare Skin: 81.5%</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #7c04f5;\">Epic Skin: 16.0%</span></li>\n<li>⭐<span style=\"color: #ffc71e;\">Legendary Skin: 2.0%</span></li>\n<li>🏖<span style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mythic Skin: 0.50%<span class=\"Tsh(Game) mobile-hidden\" style=\"position: absolute; z-index: -1; left: 0;\">Mythical</span></span></li>\n<li>🌊<span style=\"color: #e01419;\">Mythic Unit: 0.25%</span></li>\n<li>🏴‍☠️<span style=\"color: #e01419;\">Roger: 0.0025% (Not confirmed, it is speculated his chance is 1/40000)</span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Units\">Obtainable Units</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Roger.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Roger.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Roger.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Roger</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Kizume.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Kizume.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Kizume.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Kizume</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Avdo.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Avdo.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Avdo.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Avdo</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Harribu.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Harribu.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Harribu.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Harribu</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Skins\">Obtainable Skins</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skins_obtainable_from_the_Summer_Star_capsule\"><center>Skins obtainable from the Summer Star capsule</center></span></h3>\n<table 